      "body": "## [0.16.1](https://github.com/punkpeye/mcp-remote/compare/v0.16.0...v0.16.1) (2026-11-05)\n\n\n### Bug Fixes\n\n* build against zod 4.6.6 or later, outside GHSA-mrhx-c7xc-m3w5 ([#387](https://github.com/punkpeye/mcp-remote/issues/387)) ([5e407e5](https://github.com/punkpeye/mcp-remote/commit/5e407e516af22fb78263dbd556368a243179a3f0))\n",
