      "name": "v0.16.2",
      "body": "## [0.16.2](https://github.com/punkpeye/mcp-remote/compare/v0.16.1...v0.16.2) (2026-11-06)\n\n\n### Bug Fixes\n\n* ignore an empty --bind-host and keep the loopback default ([#391](https://github.com/punkpeye/mcp-remote/issues/391)) ([3b02df6](https://github.com/punkpeye/mcp-remote/commit/3b02df6c4ec95520a5b32efabecc69acdc22da3b))\n* load the cached client registration before comparing the requested scope ([#392](https://github.com/punkpeye/mcp-remote/issues/392)) ([3b5f639](https://github.com/punkpeye/mcp-remote/commit/3b5f639603b72de4d3e1f0b63343eb9b7c0b136d))\n",
      "npm_published_at": "2026-11-06T22:31:21.094Z",
